@startuml Delivery Acceptance and Closing Process

title Process: delivery, acceptance, arrival and closing
caption Target design. Decisions O8, O9, O24, O10, O25, O11, D29. Plans 14 and 15.

|Convoy Leader|
start
:Hand over each vehicle and its boxes;
:Mark vehicles and boxes delivered;
note right: the Dispatcher may mark it instead (O8)

|Receiver|
:Present the goods to Ukrainian customs;

|Convoy Leader|
:Record each goods list as accepted;
|Freedom|
:Every delivered box on that list becomes accepted;

|Dispatcher|
:Mark the convoy arrived;
|Freedom|
if (Any vehicle still travelling?) then (yes)
  :Refuse, naming the vehicles;
  stop
else (no)
  :Hand over delivered vehicles for good;
endif

|Dispatcher|
:Close the convoy;
|Freedom|
:Generate the report: budget against actuals,\nboxes by outcome, value delivered, vehicle values;
note right: no addresses or delivery detail

|Dispatcher|
if (Correction needed later?) then (yes)
  :Correct a cost or an outcome;
  note right: closing does not lock (O25)
  :Regenerate the report;
else (no)
endif
stop

@enduml
